---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Team Hub
navId: team
bodyClass: team-page
permalink: /team/
---
{% from "macros.njk" import photo %}
<section class="team-hero"><div class="team-hero-copy"><a href="/" class="breadcrumb">INDIANA ULTIMATE / THE TEAM</a><h1>YOUR TEAM.<br><span>YOUR PLACE.</span></h1><p>Meet the HoosierMama?s. Find what you need for practice, get ready for the next tournament, or take your first step onto the field.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="#join-the-team">New here? Start here</a><img src="/assets/images/mamas-red.webp" width="62" height="84" alt="HoosierMama?s question mark" class="team-emblem"></div><div class="team-hero-photo">{{ photo('dsc04969','Aidan surrounded by teammates in a close team huddle','','(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 50vw',true) }}<span>THE HoosierMama?s / INDIANA MEN'S ULTIMATE</span></div></section>
<nav class="team-tabs" aria-label="Team Hub sections"><a href="#team-today">Team essentials</a><a href="#practices">Practices</a><a href="#leadership">Leadership</a><a href="#meet-the-team">Meet the team</a><a href="#join-the-team">Join the team</a></nav>
<section id="team-today" class="team-essentials wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-label"><span class="small-square"></span> For the season ahead</p><h2>TEAM ESSENTIALS.</h2></div><p>For returning players and anyone getting to know the team.</p></div></section>
<div class="team-information wrap"><section id="practices" class="info-section"><p class="section-label">Where to be</p><h2>PRACTICES.</h2>{% if team.practices and team.practices.length %}<ul class="stack-list">{% for practice in team.practices %}<li><h3>{{ practice.when }}</h3><p>{{ practice.where }}</p>{% if practice.note %}<p>{{ practice.note }}</p>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p class="content-pending">Practice times and locations will appear here once the team supplies current details.</p>{% endif %}<a class="text-link" href="/contact-us/">Ask about the team</a></section><section id="leadership" class="info-section"><p class="section-label">Who to reach</p><h2>LEADERSHIP.</h2>{% if team.leadership and team.leadership.length %}<ul class="stack-list">{% for person in team.leadership %}<li><h3>{{ person.name }}</h3><p>{{ person.role }}{% if person.title %} · {{ person.title }}{% endif %}</p></li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p class="content-pending">Current captains, officers and coaches will be listed here when the team confirms them.</p>{% endif %}</section></div>
<section id="meet-the-team" class="team-story"><div class="team-story-photo">{{ photo('dsc03638','Dan and teammates listening together in a team huddle') }}</div><div class="team-story-copy"><p class="section-label">Meet the HoosierMama?s</p><h2>IT STARTS<br>WITH THE<br>PEOPLE.</h2><p>{{ team.intro }}</p><p>The game is part of it. So are the teammates beside you, the weekends on the road, and the people you keep coming back for.</p></div></section>
<section id="join-the-team" class="join-section wrap"><div class="join-title"><p class="section-label"><span class="small-square"></span> Your first step</p><h2>PLAY FOR<br>INDIANA.</h2><p>You don't have to know every rule to be curious. Start by getting to know the game and connecting with the team.</p></div><div class="join-details">{% if team.joinText %}<p>{{ team.joinText }}</p>{% else %}<h3>Join Indiana<br>ultimate.</h3><p class="content-pending">Tryout dates, first-practice instructions and a recruiting contact have not been added yet.</p>{% endif %}{% if team.recruitingEmail %}<a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:{{ team.recruitingEmail }}">Email the team</a>{% else %}<a class="button button-dark" href="{{ site.urls.contact }}">Contact IMUF</a>{% endif %}</div></section>
{% if team.updatedOn %}<p class="wrap content-updated">Team information updated {{ team.updatedOn }}.</p>{% endif %}
